{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something has taken all of the color and it's up to Huey to investigate! Make your way through ONE level and ONE boss to bring color back to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pigment is a platformer with a big focus on air mobility. Moving through the world will add color to the hand-drawn backgrounds and environment.\u00a0Over the course of your adventure you'll obtain the ability to jump and dash multiple times in the air and also refresh your aerial mobility options to stay airborne as long as you like.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use of a controller is highly recommended.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4160320?t=1764611998","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160320/dd6d8ddd87d6a6b7049df0f36ae5d56016e99d1e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764611998","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160320/2aad79b94bdd4c3c96976ef4c7c365417e9721ae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764611998","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160320/2aad79b94bdd4c3c96976ef4c7c365417e9721ae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764611998","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something has taken all of the color and it's up to Huey to investigate! Make your way through ONE level and ONE boss to bring color back to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pigment is a platformer with a big focus on air mobility. Moving through the world will add color to the hand-drawn backgrounds and environment.\u00a0Over the course of your adventure you'll obt